{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1341363-beasts-and-true-fae","id":1341363,"title":"Beasts and True Fae","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-14T18:20:35-07:00","id":1341363,"title":"Beasts and True Fae","content":"I just read the topic exploring whether or not Changeling makes beasts redundant. I think that one of the ways to connect Beasts and Changelings is to make True Fae Beasts/Primordials who are able to manifests their full power through feeding on human myths and legends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-14T18:42:51-07:00","id":1341370,"title":"","content":"An interesting way to draw over Beasts &quot;lairs&quot; is the idea of True Fae gaining influence over a town, forest, house, through urban legends and folklore. In doing so, they can create miracles, and influence events that way Penny Wise/ It does in Dairy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-14T19:25:59-07:00","id":1341377,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">I have been thinking a little bit about what a Changeling chronicle in a Beasts/ True Fae\u2019s lair, might be like. For inspiration, I recommend, Stephen King\u2019s <b><i>It</i></b> and Junji Ito\u2019s <b><i>Uzumaki/ Spiral</i></b>.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Here are some ideas on how a True Fae/ Beast might be able to influence their lair.</span></span></span><br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>They can sense major event\u2019s and/or someone taking something from their lair.</li> </ol><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">They can also subtly draw specific types of individuals to their lair.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">2. They can subtly influence people in their lair by planting suggestions in their heads, illusions, or speaking to them telepathically.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">3. They can telepathically use the bedlam effect against people in different areas of their lair.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">4. They can manipulate phenomenon or cause miracle affects in their lairs.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-14T20:18:44-07:00","id":1341384,"title":"","content":"Drawing on the idea of True Fae being Beasts/Primordials who are able to manifest their full powers by drawing on different folktales and mythology, True Fae should gain glamor point bonuses by feeding on human worship or the emotions their folktales inspire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-15T13:46:55-07:00","id":1341505,"title":"","content":"Doesn\u2019t the Book say that the Gentry respect Beast and sometimes invites them on wild hunts,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-15T15:43:35-07:00","id":1341512,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1341363-beasts-and-true-fae?p=1341505#post1341505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doesn\u2019t the Book say that the Gentry respect Beast and sometimes invites them on wild hunts,</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be an interesting avenue to explore the idea of True Fae being a type of primordial<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-15T19:28:41-07:00","id":1341553,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Connected to the idea of True Fae being a type of Primordial, they should be able to manifest some version of the Primordial power <i>Nightmare</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Here are some examples</span></span></span><br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Lost: Cause a character (human or changeling) to become hopelessly lost.</li> </ol><ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Trickery: create a supernatural effect associated with the Faeries. Examples include; phantom lights, strange sounds coming from nowhere, voices on the wind ect</li> <li>Faerie Dance: Force mortals to continue dancing, singing, and playing a musical instrument until they die.</li> <li>Breath of Death: The mortal target feels themselves preternaturally age and the pull of the abyss all at the same time.</li> <li>Spoil: Cause food to instantly rot.</li> <li>Riddle Task: the True Fae asks the victim a riddle and they become so obsessed with it that they turn into a drooling idiot.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","da